metadata/_sms_note = "The game's btelesa_roll_camera.bck (delfinoBoss/map/camera) baked frame by frame: the camera's eye and look-at in the casino boss room's own units (the roulettes' origins at y 500, the arena node), its up axis and its field of view, as TCameraBck::updateDemo reads the camera_model.bmd joints cam_position / cam_interest. Generated by tools/projectshine/npc82/sirena151/bck_cam153.py: do not edit by hand."
